      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "TIGER'S CHARM (1) returned a better run last time, finishing in the money (26.34) at this track behind Red Hot Rosie in a T3 RSTW. Has the early speed to land on the pace and can stick on. Didn't win last time but still ran one of the quickest times on the card. Makes plenty of appeal. TIME MEDDLER (4) used the rails draw to advantage to get home last time at this track and distance (26.47), scoring by 0.8 lengths. Expected to feature again. CENTREFOLD SAL (6) held her own to the line last start and filled a minor placing, beaten only one length (25.78) behind Doongalla Ziggy at Ballarat. The form from her last run stacks up well. Deserves a win and gets her chance. GLIMMERING (2) should be in the finish fresh from a three months break.",
